    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-δάκτῠλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ten fingers long</i> or
				<i>broad,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				16.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ten-fingered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					47.40
				</span></i>
			.</div>
